pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# #485 probe: pinyon_shift_cheats=true. Inspect both the map route and HUD;
# cheat.gps/accepted alone does not prove route guidance.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 960 3600 freeroam
capture 1200 before
cvar 1260 cheat_gps_destination 0,0,0
capture 1500 guidance
input 1560 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1590 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1680 route
input 1740 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1770 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
cvar 1800 cheat_gps_destination nan,0,0
capture 1920 invalid-target
stop 1980
